<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 29.85 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 29.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 41 basis points to 29.85 percent on Tuesday, from 30.26 percent on Monday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIP meanwhile rose 109.79 basis points to 29.8194 percent on Tuesday from 28.7215 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
